v 3
d netcalc: directed edge weights from node-level panel data
d
d Author: Necmi TALAY
d Support: https://github.com/aggilitas/stata-networks/issues
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260912
d
d Turns a long node-level panel into a panel of directed edge
d weights, ready for a fixed-effects estimator. Three templates:
d interaction, flow and attribute, each with an optional split
d into subnets.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16 or higher (for frame support)
d
f code/network_calc.ado
f code/network_calc.sthlp
f code/_netcalc_interaction.ado
f code/_netcalc_flow.ado
f code/_netcalc_attribute.ado
f code/_netcalc_frames.ado
f code/_netcalc_join.ado
f code/_netcalc_aggregate.ado
f README.md
